</tr><tr class="tpl-sidebar-heading">
<th class="" style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; padding-top: 1em;;">Authentication</th>
</tr><tr class="tpl-sidebar-content">
<td class="" style=";">
<ul><li><a href="/wiki/Special:MyLanguage/API:Tokens" title="Special:MyLanguage/API:Tokens">Get tokens for data modifying operations</a><span style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/API:Tokens" title="API:Tokens"> </a></span></li>
