</tr><tr class="tpl-sidebar-heading">
<th class="" style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; padding-top: 1em;;">Accounts and Users</th>
</tr><tr class="tpl-sidebar-content">
<td class="" style=";">
<ul><li><a href="/wiki/Special:MyLanguage/API:Account_creation" title="Special:MyLanguage/API:Account creation">Create an account</a><span style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/API:Account_creation" title="API:Account creation"> </a></span></li>
