<th class="" style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; padding-top: 1em;;">Page Operations</th>
</tr><tr class="tpl-sidebar-content">
<td class="" style=";">
<ul><li><a href="/wiki/Special:MyLanguage/API:Edit" title="Special:MyLanguage/API:Edit">Create and edit a page</a><span style="display:none"><a href="/wiki/API:Edit" title="API:Edit"> </a></span></li>
